# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# ATV2500.  24 macrocells, each with an output register (also PINNODE
# 65..88) and a buried register (PINNODE 41..64).  17 rows per macrocell:
# a 12-row sum in three groups of 4, AR and CK of each register, OE.  The
# .SP terms are shared by groups of 2 or 4 macrocells and ORed together.
# Configuration fuses from 71552, 4 per macrocell: own sum of the output
# register when used through its alias, third group joined to the pin sum,
# combinational pin, polarity.  The array reads both registers as Q.
# Without .CK a register is never clocked.

device v2500
descr ATV2500
partname v2500 ATV2500
pins 40
power 30 10
fuses 71648
array 172 416
