# ATV2500B.  ATV2500 map plus 97 fuses from 71649, 4 per macrocell: output
# register T, buried register T, output register CE, buried register CE.
# With .CE the register is clocked by pin 1 and its CK row is the enable;
# .CE with .CK is rejected (0006cc).  The third row group joins the pin sum
